# Usage guidelines:
# Any File extensions to be ignored should get their own line and start with a .
# Any specific files or folders to be ignored should have their full path included, for example "src/main/example.java" or "src/main/example" for the example folder
# Files and Folders will only be ignored if the path is a FULL MATCH
# To included files or folders of a specific pattern, start with "*/" 
# for example "*/example.java" will ignore all files of the name "example.java", regardless of their location in the directory
# for example "*/example" will ignore all folders of the name "example", regardless of their location in the directory

# Media Files
.jpg
.jpeg
